- Integrity of supraspinatus, infraspinatus, subscapularis, and teres minor tendons (full/partial tear, tendinosis);  
- Thickness and signal intensity of the inferior glenohumeral ligament and coracohumeral ligament;  
- Presence of capsular enhancement or synovitis.

